  "title": "Victoria Sponge Cake",
  "description": "Victoria sponge cake is a light, tender layer cake filled with strawberry jam and vanilla whipped cream for a simple, elegant treat fit for a Queen!",
  "authors": [
    "Caroline Victoria"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:49:06-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-04-21T12:09:57-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT100M",
  "yield": [
    "10",
    "1 2-layer (8-inch) cake"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert",
    "Cake"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "English",
    "British"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "English",
    "British"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 tablespoon cornstarch",
    "3/4 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1 cup granulated sugar",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "2 large eggs, room temperature",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 cup milk, room temperature",
    "1/2 cup strawberry preserves",
    "¾ cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 tablespoons powdered sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "fresh strawberries"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (160 degrees C). Grease two 8-inch round cake pans with baking spray; line bottoms with parchment paper. Lightly spray parchment paper with baking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qbh50rw85KVh4Ddv4IycMk2DUvI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step1-4x3-0010-43c94bcd3d514394b001ef580c859312.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, cornstarch, and baking powder into a medium bowl; whisk in salt and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HLvtkgvTet4xVrHVIFBh6lbQNB0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0010-4c988bc5ff28425c9c566f99d3f00b16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter with an electric mixer on medium speed until light and fluffy, about 3 to 4 minutes, stopping to scrape down sides as needed. (The mixture should be noticeably lighter in color.)",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WnjDeMY9oo-2K3MwalGeUzFo2ZI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-vanilla-buttercream-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0027-b05cd55fc20540d29965a2c6354561b6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in eggs, one at a time, on medium speed, allowing each egg to blend into butter mixture before adding the next, 1 to 2 minutes total. Beat in 2 teaspoons vanilla. With mixer on medium-low speed, add flour mixture in 3 batches, alternating with milk, beating until just combined after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F4k93co7-xOlBnJysZ9B6K3JDFc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-vanilla-buttercream-ddmfs-step4-4x3-0030-5046fd9aa7d54116ba47b1e3dfa7bc9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly divide batter between prepared pans and spread into an even layer using a small offset spatula. Firmly tap pans on a kitchen towel-lined counter several times to help get rid of any large bubbles in the batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UFCcyW4JyHOFstOgv8MHNP9B-5w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step5-4x3-0018-6e1cec31106d44eaae4edf50531e5b73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean, about 18 to 22 minutes. Cool cakes in the pans for 10 minutes, then turn the cakes out onto a wire rack. Let stand, parchment side down, on wire racks until cooled completely, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cFeyHmDQ25iRvNY5R22Tsfa0ztQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step6-4x3--21f410b2339f48648a2b4143da1f4e1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard parchment paper. Place 1 cake layer on a serving plate. Stir preserves in a small bowl until mostly smooth; spread in an even layer over cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d0tyLcCk-vXr_G_FH4qfuzTRSTE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step7-4x3--5896d3e849d94b7b9769f288d866635d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make vanilla whipped cream: Whisk heavy whipping cream, powdered sugar, and 1 teaspoon vanilla extract by hand in a large bowl until stiff peaks form, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UyIlNjosHkGrd_Fv8Ry1f7klCXs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-vanilla-whipped-cream-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0020-c6c25415dd7a4a67bfebb5b4a82e0d9d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dollop over jam, then spread into an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vqZqrmAw9Sj-grt_IOzcMSQJ93U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step8-4x3--d9876b3c7d8f4bcfad6024e2fac1548a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with remaining cake layer. Dust with powdered sugar and garnish with strawberries (if using).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fquAEB7znSZS5bYcsOfAkp3qk7A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/141783-victoria-sponge-cake-ddmfs-step9-4x3-00300173-9d12daee4e2e43ef8f1c90af8efea135.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/141783/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
